    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Weeks are simulated** (1 to 13) and are plotted as categories, not as time. Inputs and score describe week N the day it runs. **Performance and slices need labels, which arrive a week late**, so they show week N only after week N+1 has run (week 9's labels never arrive: its batch was blocked). Alerts repeat from week 5 because the drift baseline stays the champion's training window until a new model is promoted."
   },
